              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi lapho kubikwa kuSawule, wathuma ezinye izithunywa, nazo zaprofetha ngokunjalo. USawule waphinda wathuma izithunywa ngokwesithathu, nazo zaprofetha.",
          "type": "text",
