              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye wakhumula izingubo zakhe, waprofetha ngokunjalo phambi kukaSamuweli, walala enqunu usuku lonke nobusuku bonke. Ngakho bathi: Kambe uSawuli laye uphakathi kwabaprofethi yini?",
          "type": "text",
